      "text": [
        " : رَأَيْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ يَأْكُلُ مُتَّكِئاً ثُمَّ ذَكَرَ رَسُولَ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ فَقَالَ \"مَا أَكَلَ مُتَّكِئاً حَتَّى مَاتَ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4248 - It is narrated from Umar ibn Abi Shu'bah who said:\n\"I saw Abu Abdullah Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) eating while reclining.\nThen Imam (as) mentioned the Messenger of Allah (swt), peace and blessings be upon him and his family, and said: 'He never ate while reclining until he passed away.' \""
        ]
      }
